data: {"id": "68475a1829324ffd-thinking-parallel_evidence-2705", "run_id": "68475a1829324ffd", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_token", "tool_name": null, "content": "趋势", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788457105968, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: thinking
data: {"id": "68475a1829324ffd-thinking-parallel_evidence-2706", "run_id": "68475a1829324ffd", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "很好，日志查询成功。从结果可以看到：\n\n**关键证据：**\n1. **内存分配模式**：日志显示多次 \"memory allocation advanced\" 事件，分配的内存从 10 MiB、12 MiB 到 48 MiB 递增\n2. **时间窗口**：所有日志都在崩溃窗口内（17:34:19 到 17:34:57），接近 17:34:59 的终止时间\n3. **内存使用趋势**：从 10 MiB → 12 MiB → 48 MiB，接近 64 MiB 的内存限制\n4. **应用行为**：所有日志都是 http_request 事件，HTTP 状态 200，说明应用在崩溃前仍在正常响应请求，但在不断分配内存\n\n**与 OOMKilled 的关联：**\n- Pod 的内存限制为 64 MiB\n- 最后一条日志显示已分配 48 MiB，接近上限\n- 应用持续分配内存，最终触发 OOMKilled（退出码 137）\n\n现在让我检查一下是否还有其他维度的查询失败需要处理。根据用户输入，只有 query_pod_logs 这一项失败了，现在已成功修正并执行。\n\n让我总结一下本轮修正后的结果：\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788457106017, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "68475a1829324ffd-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "68475a1829324ffd", "seq": 2707, "ts_ms": 1788457116375, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 151.786, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-08", "name": "workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/68475a1829324ffd-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "b186ff780abeda411e39b99cedc6aa5c25b259df01f76735a25cb0460ee0451a", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "c105ed550f56e3406e280caf55f8ee63b6ab75a8d9c3ab4585a539335a627134"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "68475a1829324ffd-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "68475a1829324ffd", "seq": 2708, "ts_ms": 1788457116376, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "68475a1829324ffd-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "68475a1829324ffd", "seq": 2709, "ts_ms": 1788457127112, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 10.736, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1520, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h` | CrashLoopBackOff | CrashLoopBackOff |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `reason: OOMKilled` (fact-0696ea453721) | 确认容器因超出资源上限被内核强制终止 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `resource_limit.memory: 64Mi` (fact-220a641b6dec) | 提供判定 OOM 的硬阈值依据 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Exit Code: 137` 及 `Back-off restarting failed container app` (fact-f9e1754a32fc, fact-192dd219139f) | 佐证容器异常退出及随后的重启循环机制 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `container_memory_working_set_bytes` 峰值达 `63856640` Bytes (约 60.9Mi)，发生于 16:23 (fact-63105fc574b9) | 证明应用实际内存消耗极度逼近 64Mi 限制，触发 OOM 的直接前置条件 |\n| 5 | Logging | elasticsearch | `allocated_mib` 在请求处理窗口内从 `10` 激增至 `48` (fact-3bd4fdc80c2b) | 刻画应用内存增长的速率与幅度，表明存在突发或累积性的内存分配行为 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nK8s 指标 (fact-63105fc574b9) 记录到内存峰值约为 60.9Mi，非常接近配置的上限 64Mi (fact-220a641b6dec)，这与日志 (fact-3bd4fdc80c2b) 显示的请求内内存分配量达到 48Mi 的峰值高度吻合。结合内核返回的 `OOMKilled` (fact-0696ea453721) 和退出码 `137` (fact-f9e1754a32fc)，逻辑闭环确认了内存超限是终止容器的唯一原因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用每次请求处理中内存分配增长 (10Mi -> 48Mi) → 内存峰值触及 64Mi 容器限制硬上限 → 触发 OOMKilled (Exit Code 137) → 容器持续崩溃重启导致 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n根因已确认为 **`Container memory limit (64Mi) is insufficient for the application's memory growth pattern`**。\n\n证据链 (事实 1, 2, 4, 5) 表明，应用在处理请求时会出现显著的内存增长，其峰值消耗 (约 60.9Mi) 极其逼近当前设定的容器内存硬限制 (64Mi)。由于缺乏内存缓冲空间，容器达到了 OOM Kill 阈值，导致进程被 Linux OOM Killer 终止。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h` | CrashLoopBackOff | CrashLoopBackOff |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `reason: OOMKilled` (fact-0696ea453721) | 确认容器因超出资源上限被内核强制终止 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `resource_limit.memory: 64Mi` (fact-220a641b6dec) | 提供判定 OOM 的硬阈值依据 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Exit Code: 137` 及 `Back-off restarting failed container app` (fact-f9e1754a32fc, fact-192dd219139f) | 佐证容器异常退出及随后的重启循环机制 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `container_memory_working_set_bytes` 峰值达 `63856640` Bytes (约 60.9Mi)，发生于 16:23 (fact-63105fc574b9) | 证明应用实际内存消耗极度逼近 64Mi 限制，触发 OOM 的直接前置条件 |\n| 5 | Logging | elasticsearch | `allocated_mib` 在请求处理窗口内从 `10` 激增至 `48` (fact-3bd4fdc80c2b) | 刻画应用内存增长的速率与幅度，表明存在突发或累积性的内存分配行为 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nK8s 指标 (fact-63105fc574b9) 记录到内存峰值约为 60.9Mi，非常接近配置的上限 64Mi (fact-220a641b6dec)，这与日志 (fact-3bd4fdc80c2b) 显示的请求内内存分配量达到 48Mi 的峰值高度吻合。结合内核返回的 `OOMKilled` (fact-0696ea453721) 和退出码 `137` (fact-f9e1754a32fc)，逻辑闭环确认了内存超限是终止容器的唯一原因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用每次请求处理中内存分配增长 (10Mi -> 48Mi) → 内存峰值触及 64Mi 容器限制硬上限 → 触发 OOMKilled (Exit Code 137) → 容器持续崩溃重启导致 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n根因已确认为 **`Container memory limit (64Mi) is insufficient for the application's memory growth pattern`**。\n\n证据链 (事实 1, 2, 4, 5) 表明，应用在处理请求时会出现显著的内存增长，其峰值消耗 (约 60.9Mi) 极其逼近当前设定的容器内存硬限制 (64Mi)。由于缺乏内存缓冲空间，容器达到了 OOM Kill 阈值，导致进程被 Linux OOM Killer 终止。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "68475a1829324ffd-final", "run_id": "68475a1829324ffd", "seq": 2711, "ts_ms": 1788457127126, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h` | CrashLoopBackOff | CrashLoopBackOff |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `reason: OOMKilled` (fact-0696ea453721) | 确认容器因超出资源上限被内核强制终止 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `resource_limit.memory: 64Mi` (fact-220a641b6dec) | 提供判定 OOM 的硬阈值依据 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Exit Code: 137` 及 `Back-off restarting failed container app` (fact-f9e1754a32fc, fact-192dd219139f) | 佐证容器异常退出及随后的重启循环机制 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `container_memory_working_set_bytes` 峰值达 `63856640` Bytes (约 60.9Mi)，发生于 16:23 (fact-63105fc574b9) | 证明应用实际内存消耗极度逼近 64Mi 限制，触发 OOM 的直接前置条件 |\n| 5 | Logging | elasticsearch | `allocated_mib` 在请求处理窗口内从 `10` 激增至 `48` (fact-3bd4fdc80c2b) | 刻画应用内存增长的速率与幅度，表明存在突发或累积性的内存分配行为 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nK8s 指标 (fact-63105fc574b9) 记录到内存峰值约为 60.9Mi，非常接近配置的上限 64Mi (fact-220a641b6dec)，这与日志 (fact-3bd4fdc80c2b) 显示的请求内内存分配量达到 48Mi 的峰值高度吻合。结合内核返回的 `OOMKilled` (fact-0696ea453721) 和退出码 `137` (fact-f9e1754a32fc)，逻辑闭环确认了内存超限是终止容器的唯一原因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用每次请求处理中内存分配增长 (10Mi -> 48Mi) → 内存峰值触及 64Mi 容器限制硬上限 → 触发 OOMKilled (Exit Code 137) → 容器持续崩溃重启导致 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n根因已确认为 **`Container memory limit (64Mi) is insufficient for the application's memory growth pattern`**。\n\n证据链 (事实 1, 2, 4, 5) 表明，应用在处理请求时会出现显著的内存增长，其峰值消耗 (约 60.9Mi) 极其逼近当前设定的容器内存硬限制 (64Mi)。由于缺乏内存缓冲空间，容器达到了 OOM Kill 阈值，导致进程被 Linux OOM Killer 终止。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 3.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 151.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h: 151.8s (Evidence 141.6s, RCA 10.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 177.633, "metrics": {"run_id": "68475a1829324ffd", "mttr": {"value": "3.0m", "seconds": 177.6373405456543, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 177637.3405456543, "llm_calls": 20, "llm_duration_ms": 128840.42143821716, "tool_calls": 24, "executed_tool_calls": 20, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 21, "failed_tool_calls": 3, "tool_duration_ms": 101774.0068435669, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 48154.722452163696}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15091.278314590454, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "d